  "draft": "scheme ropSchemes \"Кодирование, инфраструктура и доступ РОП\"\ndiagram D04_coding \"Схема кодирования модельного ряда\" type=coding\ncodePattern bomCode \"Формат кода модельного ряда\" description=\"При исчерпании диапазона миграция формата. Версия хранится отдельно как version_no.\"\nsegment bomPrefix Префикс kind=literal literal=\"Модельный ряд\" meaning=\"Тип объекта: конфигурация\\nПостоянный префикс\" order=0 owner=bomCode\nsegment bomSeparator Разделитель kind=literal literal=\"-\" meaning=\"Разделитель по DEFAULT таблицы bom\" order=1 owner=bomCode\nsegment bomNumber \"Порядковый номер\" alphabet=digits example=000153 kind=counter meaning=\"Номер из sequence\\n000001–999999\" order=2 owner=bomCode width=6\nview bomCodeView \"\" diagram=D04_coding element=bomCode\nnote D04_coding.note Примечание text=\"При исчерпании диапазона миграция формата. Версия хранится отдельно как version_no.\"\nview D04_coding.noteView \"\" diagram=D04_coding element=D04_coding.note\ndiagram D10_infrastructure \"Инфраструктурная схема\" type=infrastructure\nblock D10_infrastructure.client \"Рабочие станции\\nБраузеры сотрудников\" role=client shape=rectangle technology=Браузер\nview D10_infrastructure.client_view \"\" diagram=D10_infrastructure element=D10_infrastructure.client\nblock D10_infrastructure.edge \"Шлюз / DMZ\\nNginx: HTTPS 443\\nTLS и маршрутизация\" role=gateway shape=rectangle technology=Nginx\nview D10_infrastructure.edge_view \"\" diagram=D10_infrastructure element=D10_infrastructure.edge\nblock D10_infrastructure.app \"Прикладной сервер\\nJRE 21: Spring Boot\\nAPI и worker публикаций\" role=application shape=rectangle technology=\"JRE / Spring Boot\" version=\"21 (JRE)\"\nview D10_infrastructure.app_view \"\" diagram=D10_infrastructure element=D10_infrastructure.app\nblock D10_infrastructure.db \"Сервер БД\\nPostgreSQL 18\\nДанные и очередь\" role=database shape=cylinder technology=PostgreSQL version=18\nview D10_infrastructure.db_view \"\" diagram=D10_infrastructure element=D10_infrastructure.db\nblock D10_infrastructure.media \"Файловое хранилище\\nИзображения по storage_key\" role=storage shape=cylinder\nview D10_infrastructure.media_view \"\" diagram=D10_infrastructure element=D10_infrastructure.media\nblock D10_infrastructure.ext \"Ozon и поставщики\\nИнтернет\" role=external shape=cloud\nview D10_infrastructure.ext_view \"\" diagram=D10_infrastructure element=D10_infrastructure.ext\nblock D10_infrastructure.backup \"Резервное хранилище\\nБД и изображения\\nОтдельные учётные данные\" role=storage shape=cylinder\nview D10_infrastructure.backup_view \"\" diagram=D10_infrastructure element=D10_infrastructure.backup\nlink D10_infrastructure.link1 \"HTTPS 443\" from=D10_infrastructure.client kind=directed port=443 protocol=HTTPS to=D10_infrastructure.edge\nview D10_infrastructure.link1_view \"\" diagram=D10_infrastructure element=D10_infrastructure.link1 from=D10_infrastructure.client_view to=D10_infrastructure.edge_view\nlink D10_infrastructure.link2 \"HTTPS 8443\" from=D10_infrastructure.edge kind=directed port=8443 protocol=HTTPS to=D10_infrastructure.app\nview D10_infrastructure.link2_view \"\" diagram=D10_infrastructure element=D10_infrastructure.link2 from=D10_infrastructure.edge_view to=D10_infrastructure.app_view\nlink D10_infrastructure.link3 \"TLS 5432\" from=D10_infrastructure.app kind=directed port=5432 protocol=TLS to=D10_infrastructure.db\nview D10_infrastructure.link3_view \"\" diagram=D10_infrastructure element=D10_infrastructure.link3 from=D10_infrastructure.app_view to=D10_infrastructure.db_view\nlink D10_infrastructure.link4 \"HTTPS 443\" from=D10_infrastructure.app kind=directed port=443 protocol=HTTPS to=D10_infrastructure.ext\nview D10_infrastructure.link4_view \"\" diagram=D10_infrastructure element=D10_infrastructure.link4 from=D10_infrastructure.app_view to=D10_infrastructure.ext_view\nlink D10_infrastructure.link5 \"копия БД\" from=D10_infrastructure.db kind=directed purpose=\"копия БД\" 